      "notes": "RETRONET BRIDGE: net0 is a tap on vmbr-rn (NOT slirp); guest is static 10.99.0.14/24, NO default route (rn-tapnet.sh + fail-closed guard chain SOLRN-IN). gallery-hid-pci is the live pointer device (native GalleryHidSink); the in-guest warpd agent (guest :7777) is reached DIRECTLY over the bridge at 10.99.0.14:7777 for rollback and its 'E' exec verb (exec_kind warpd_e, host client /root/gexec.py, GEXEC_HOST=exec_host, no hostfwd). exec: labctl exec solaris \"<cmd>\". Pidgin 2.10.4 (GTK2 desktop OSCAR client, SUNWgnome-im-client) auto-signs-in as UIN 30000 to the gateway 10.99.0.2:5190 from /.purple/accounts.xml and renders the server-side SSI roster in its Buddy List. See docs/lab/retronet/ICQ-STATION-solaris.md"
    }
